1
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:08,880
(Sheldon:)Dr. Leonard Hofstadter,

2
00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:10,380
(Sheldon:)you are officially charged

3
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,730
(Sheldon:)with two violations
of the roommate agreement.

4
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:14,250
(Sheldon:)Do you waive

5
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:16,000
(Sheldon:)reading of the charges?

6
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:17,140
(Leonard:)Yeah, fine.

7
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,470
(Priya:)Hang on. No.

8
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:20,990
(Priya:)My client does not waive
reading of the charges.

9
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:22,260
(Priya:)Oh.

10
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:25,260
(Leonard:)Cool. I've got
a lawyer.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,520
(Leonard:)And I've seen her naked.

12
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:31,870
(Priya:)Proceed.

13
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:33,470
(Sheldon:)Very well.

14
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:35,970
"Count the first:

15
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:38,480
"On or about
the 28th day of April,

16
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:41,280
"the accused did knowingly
and with malice aforethought

17
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:43,250
"deny access
to the shared bathroom

18
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:47,040
"in a time of emergency, to wit,
my back teeth were floating.

19
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:51,290
"Count the second:
the accused exceeded

20
00:00:51,290 --> 00:00:53,590
"the agreed upon occupancy
of the shower,

21
00:00:53,590 --> 00:00:56,260
"to wit, one,
unless we are under attack

22
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:58,130
by water-soluble aliens."

23
00:00:59,930 --> 00:01:02,300
(Priya:)Can I see
the roommate agreement?

